%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'noteBkgColor': '#E8E8E8', 'noteBorderColor': '#999999', 'noteTextColor': '#1a1a1a'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Traveler
    participant W as Web App (Frontend)
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant Pay as Payment Gateway (UPI)
    actor P as Storage Partner

    Note over T,DB: Discovery & booking (DFD P2, P31, P32)
    T->>W: Search storage near location
    W->>API: GET /listings?city=&near=
    API->>DB: Query available listings (D2)
    DB-->>API: Matching listings
    API-->>W: Available storage options
    W-->>T: Display storage options

    T->>W: Select partner, time slot, confirm booking
    W->>API: POST /bookings
    activate API
    API->>DB: Validate slot against availability & pricing (P31)
    DB-->>API: Availability confirmed
    API->>Pay: Charge booking amount
    Pay-->>API: Payment captured
    API->>DB: Create booking record, generate QR/OTP (P32)
    API->>DB: Update listing availability (D2)
    API-->>W: Booking confirmation + QR/OTP
    deactivate API
    W-->>T: Show booking ID and QR/OTP

    Note over T,P: Drop-off handoff (DFD P33, P34)
    T->>P: Present check-in QR/OTP
    P->>API: POST /bookings/{id}/verify-checkin
    activate API
    API->>DB: Match handoff details against booking (P33)
    DB-->>API: Handoff verified
    deactivate API
    P->>API: Upload drop-off photo, confirm drop-off
    API->>DB: Record drop-off, set status = Stored (P34)
    API-->>P: Drop-off confirmed
    API-->>T: Notify: luggage stored

    Note over T,Pay: Pickup & settlement (DFD P35, P4)
    T->>P: Present retrieval QR/OTP
    P->>API: POST /bookings/{id}/verify-pickup
    activate API
    API->>DB: Verify pickup details against booking (P35)
    DB-->>API: Pickup verified
    API->>DB: Mark booking Completed, restore availability
    API->>Pay: Release partner payout
    Pay-->>API: Payout settled
    deactivate API
    API-->>P: Pickup confirmed + payout status
    API-->>T: Booking completed, request rating
    T->>W: Submit post-pickup rating
    W->>API: POST /bookings/{id}/rating
    API->>DB: Store rating
